{"data": [{"author_id": "2103198382604845057", "created_at": "2026-11-17T23:19:26.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122832010875937135"], "id": "2122832010875937135", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Your coding agent just broke prod at 2am, nobody else awake to ask.\n\nWhich one do you want on call?\n\nClaude Code\nCodex\nCursor\nGemini CLI\n\nPick one. Say why.", "url": "https://x.com/PhemeWhispers/status/2122832010875937135"}, {"author_id": "1904200133933514752", "created_at": "2026-11-17T19:34:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122775279206854920"], "entities": {"mentions": [{"end": 111, "id": "2752941746", "start": 99, "username": "simbaTmotsi"}]}, "id": "2122775279206854920", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 34, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Did your coding agent just run a migration or test loop against a live database? simba-skills from @simbaTmotsi is six agent skills that check write targets first and refuse live databases. It also covers safe deploys with backup and rollback note, nightly Postgres backups with", "url": "https://x.com/EveryDevAi/status/2122775279206854920"}, {"author_id": "2077671966912430080", "created_at": "2026-11-17T02:05:18.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122511364518469673"], "id": "2122511364518469673", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 128, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Two repos let a coding agent make short animated videos on your own computer by writing every scene as code.\n\nFor people who make promo clips or explainers with Claude Code or another coding agent.\n\n→ motlab (staryone/motlab): a video engine where each scene is a canvas page", "url": "https://x.com/ai_algoit/status/2122511364518469673"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2122770050369339392"]}, "author_id": "2091052391902916608", "created_at": "2026-11-17T19:13:26.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122770103955825001"], "id": "2122770103955825001", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 29, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Your coding agent just learned to edit video.\n\nffmpeg-skill gives Claude Code, Cursor or Codex 42 tools to cut, caption, reframe and export for TikTok.\n\nRuns on your laptop. No cloud, no API key. 5,000+ GitHub stars.\n\n\"Make this a 60-second Reel\" is now a prompt. https://t.co/chjKVmIgn9", "url": "https://x.com/askpert_dev/status/2122770103955825001"}, {"author_id": "1847773141231423489", "created_at": "2026-11-17T22:34:07.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122820606240653803"], "id": "2122820606240653803", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 30, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 4, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Asked my coding agent to port a slow TypeScript loop to Rust. It said done. Nothing proved the output matched.\n\nrust-anything (Rust, MIT) records what your app does today and replays every case against the port. Any mismatch fails the gate. MCP for Claude Code, Codex, Cursor", "url": "https://x.com/sunsetsyntax/status/2122820606240653803"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2122745926452408320"]}, "author_id": "1691429003671060480", "created_at": "2026-11-17T17:41:08.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122746875631784127"], "id": "2122746875631784127", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 141, "like_count": 4, "quote_count": 2, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "SuperPenguin 🐧 is now past 10T tokens a month!\n\nWe find what to cut in your AI spend, across your AI product and coding tools (Claude Code, Codex, Cursor). Each optimization comes with a fix for your coding agent.\n\nIf we don't save you more than we cost, you shouldn't pay us https://t.co/dQRUX2BUzo", "url": "https://x.com/yuta__baba/status/2122746875631784127"}, {"author_id": "1024837883004215296", "created_at": "2026-11-17T15:08:15.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122708402459545770"], "entities": {"mentions": [{"end": 83, "id": "1536693901230321666", "start": 67, "username": "RoundtableSpace"}], "urls": [{"end": 303, "start": 280, "url": "https://t.co/SnmMWi3w1Q"}]}, "id": "2122708402459545770", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 163, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 4, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2122536454538608872", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Video editing is quietly becoming a coding-agent job. According to @RoundtableSpace, Claude Code, Cursor and Codex can now cut video locally with ffmpeg-skill — a free, MIT-licensed skill and MCP server packing 42 FFmpeg tools.\n\nCutting, captioning, reframing, loudness fixes and https://t.co/SnmMWi3w1Q", "url": "https://x.com/LilithLiJapan/status/2122708402459545770"}, {"author_id": "2073821095069986816", "created_at": "2026-11-17T21:32:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122804974073872765"], "id": "2122804974073872765", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 2, "impression_count": 353, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "10 AI TOOLS THAT EVERY SOFTWARE ENGINEER SHOULD KNOW IN 2026:\n\nCursor – AI-powered coding\nClaude Code – Autonomous coding agent\nGitHub Copilot – AI pair programmer\nv0 – UI generation\nLovable – Build full-stack apps\nPerplexity – AI-powered research\nNotebookLM – Understand", "url": "https://x.com/MansiCodez/status/2122804974073872765"}, {"author_id": "1040444698890985472", "created_at": "2026-11-17T14:02:51.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122691943344021685"], "id": "2122691943344021685", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 10, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Your AI coding agent can now send files straight to your phone. PairOnce's MCP server lets tools like Claude Code, Cursor and Codex pair once and send a file or a text to your phone — no app, no upload, no cloud copy in between. The file goes device to device, right in the", "url": "https://x.com/PairOnce/status/2122691943344021685"}, {"author_id": "1904200133933514752", "created_at": "2026-11-17T17:27:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122743318853595278"], "id": "2122743318853595278", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 29, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Losing track of what your coding agents are doing while you jump between Slack, Linear and meetings? Tamekoshi is an AI companion that sits at the top of your screen for voice calls, background tasks, meeting notes and coding agent monitoring. Write actions need approval. Paid,", "url": "https://x.com/EveryDevAi/status/2122743318853595278"}, {"author_id": "14280268", "created_at": "2026-11-17T02:54:53.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122523842233192611"], "id": "2122523842233192611", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 180, "like_count": 4, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "🎁 Every Slack sample app now comes with the Slack Skills Plugin's skills built in\n\n• Claude Code: loads them from `.claude/skills/`.\n• Codex, Cursor, OpenCode, and more: load them from `.agents/skills/`.\n• `npx skills update` refreshes them from the lock file.\n\nMy favourite", "url": "https://x.com/mwbrooks/status/2122523842233192611"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2122728998119583744"]}, "author_id": "830989807367159808", "created_at": "2026-11-17T20:17:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122786099592360304"], "id": "2122786099592360304", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 2, "impression_count": 291, "like_count": 3, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 6, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "I don't run every job on GrokBot.\n\nCoding work goes to Claude Code, on a shared computer, not my PC. Thumbnails go to a Codex setup I run myself. Grok Bots do the crew work: drafts, inbox, research, and meetings.\n\nThe official docs say a Grok Bot can hand coding work to Cursor https://t.co/yDINaZeSMV", "url": "https://x.com/KacperRutk/status/2122786099592360304"}, {"author_id": "2561444924", "created_at": "2026-11-17T16:17:41.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122725874479009956"], "id": "2122725874479009956", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 92, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "🤯 What if your AI coding agent had an entire marketing team?\n\nAaron Marketing Skills brings 120 AI-powered skills into one open-source toolkit.\n\nIt covers:\n→ SEO &amp; GEO\n→ Social media strategy\n→ Email marketing\n→ Paid advertising\n→ Influencer campaigns\n→ Product launches\n→", "url": "https://x.com/AKhomssi/status/2122725874479009956"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["16_2122688856302727168"]}, "author_id": "2058565082628739072", "created_at": "2026-11-17T13:50:40.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122688877215543525"], "id": "2122688877215543525", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 526, "like_count": 16, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 14, "retweet_count": 2}, "text": "Your coding agent can help build your voice agent.\n\nDograh is an open-source, self-hostable alternative to Vapi and Retell.\n\nIts MCP server lets Claude Code, Codex, and Cursor create and edit voice-agent workflows.\n\nInspect the flow in a visual builder, test conversations with https://t.co/abictNCveY", "url": "https://x.com/jurlycat/status/2122688877215543525"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2122609243832664064", "3_2122609253567676416", "3_2122609261767499776", "3_2122609272123162624"]}, "author_id": "2060428838551822336", "created_at": "2026-11-17T08:34:23.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122609279815516286"], "entities": {"mentions": [{"end": 97, "id": "33836629", "start": 88, "username": "karpathy"}, {"end": 161, "id": "159337660", "start": 153, "username": "bcherny"}, {"end": 216, "id": "352806502", "start": 209, "username": "trq212"}]}, "id": "2122609279815516286", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 3, "impression_count": 386, "like_count": 28, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 10, "retweet_count": 15}, "text": "Best accounts to follow from each frontier lab to stay constantly up to date\n\nAnthropic\n@karpathy -must-follow account for AI; recently joined Anthropic\n@bcherny -Claude Code creator, always shares great tips\n@trq212- also a Claude Code developer; writes amazing articles on CC https://t.co/gCbnX4WE9S", "url": "https://x.com/JoyaExploresAI/status/2122609279815516286"}, {"author_id": "1378993926871281668", "created_at": "2026-11-17T20:21:52.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122787325704900717"], "id": "2122787325704900717", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 8, "impression_count": 4292, "like_count": 31, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 16, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "AI product manager 1: \"i love vibe coding man\"\nAI product manager 2: \"me too man im addicted to vibe coding\"\nAI pm 1: \"what tools do you use?\"\nAI pm2: \"i use claude it's so great\"\nAI pm1: \"u use claude or claude code theres a big difference haha\"\nAI pm2: \"obv claude code man im", "url": "https://x.com/sugandhanisa/status/2122787325704900717"}, {"author_id": "1454078145343094785", "created_at": "2026-11-17T19:59:07.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122781599783874882"], "id": "2122781599783874882", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 33, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "AI code generation has a dirty secret: it all looks like the exact same generic AI slop.\n\nCream background. Thin serif font. Pill buttons. Zero soul.\n\nImpeccable fixes this forever. It's an open-source design vocabulary layer for your coding agent (Cursor, Claude Code, Copilot,", "url": "https://x.com/JohnxxWang/status/2122781599783874882"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2122795897981472768"]}, "author_id": "1406639376675770374", "created_at": "2026-11-17T20:55:58.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122795905602740651"], "id": "2122795905602740651", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 6, "impression_count": 779, "like_count": 6, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 4, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Your site builds. Can search crawlers actually read it?\n\nSEO Prompt Master is a technical SEO and AI-search audit toolkit for developers, combining a CLI, coding-agent skill, prompt library, and cited knowledge base.\n\nIt helps you find crawl and indexing problems by checking live https://t.co/XNr6rAyexs", "url": "https://x.com/DanKornas/status/2122795905602740651"}, {"author_id": "2116995600973451264", "created_at": "2026-11-17T04:42:07.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122550830960173419"], "id": "2122550830960173419", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 117, "like_count": 3, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Your AI coding agent can now edit VIDEO. Locally. For free.\n\nffmpeg-skill is an open-source Agent Skill that gives Claude Code, Cursor, Codex or any MCP client a full video editor powered by your own local FFmpeg.\n\nWhat it ships:\n\n- 42 tools: cut, join, silence removal, captions", "url": "https://x.com/Pro_Algorithm/status/2122550830960173419"}, {"author_id": "2116995600973451264", "created_at": "2026-11-17T01:56:37.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122509181676621956"], "id": "2122509181676621956", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 2, "impression_count": 373, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 3, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Google is giving your coding agent a design team. For free.\n\nIt's called Stitch Skills, from Google Labs, and it's climbing GitHub trending right now: 500+ stars today, almost 10,000 total.\n\nWhat it is:\nA collection of agent skills and plugins for Google Stitch, built on the open", "url": "https://x.com/Pro_Algorithm/status/2122509181676621956"}, {"author_id": "1647589155881492482", "created_at": "2026-11-17T13:24:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122682164990939633"], "id": "2122682164990939633", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 18, "like_count": 3, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Your coding agent spends a lot of tokens reading entire files just to find one function.\n\nSemble is a code search tool built for agents.\n\nAsk questions in plain language and get back only the relevant code snippets.\n\nIt runs on CPU, requires no API keys, and integrates with", "url": "https://x.com/0xpiyushvm/status/2122682164990939633"}, {"author_id": "1133844519609360385", "created_at": "2026-11-17T11:19:30.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122650833670279550"], "id": "2122650833670279550", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 73, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Your coding agent can now edit video. Locally, with FFmpeg, through MCP.\n\nffmpeg-skill: 42 typed tools (cut, caption, silence removal, aspect fit, loudness). Claude Code and Cursor read the contract, probe first, then verify output.", "url": "https://x.com/disismohi/status/2122650833670279550"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2122782462392827905"]}, "author_id": "1861308613563949057", "created_at": "2026-11-17T20:02:40.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122782495049753042"], "id": "2122782495049753042", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 2, "impression_count": 2000, "like_count": 21, "quote_count": 3, "reply_count": 10, "retweet_count": 5}, "text": "Handle Studio tasks from your coding agent.\n\nConnect Claude Code, Cursor or VS Code to Mastra's new built-in MCP server.\n\nThen call your agents, run workflows or read traces with a prompt: https://t.co/dblfyC2ZYB", "url": "https://x.com/mastra/status/2122782495049753042"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2122718603166261248"]}, "author_id": "2007551502819426304", "created_at": "2026-11-17T15:48:58.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122718648577990939"], "entities": {"mentions": [{"end": 92, "id": "12497", "start": 85, "username": "simonw"}]}, "id": "2122718648577990939", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Want your coding agent to run commands without the keys to your whole Mac?\n\nNew from @simonw and Prime Radiant: external sandboxes. Claude Code, Codex or Pi stay on your Mac. Their commands run in a Linux sandbox that sees only the folders you mount, with no network unless you https://t.co/vG3JlZAtWR", "url": "https://x.com/botsherpa705/status/2122718648577990939"}, {"author_id": "274770016", "created_at": "2026-11-17T18:15:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122755399522693363"], "id": "2122755399522693363", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 514, "like_count": 7, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 6, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "99% of AI tools have no moat now that Claude Code and Codex exist.\n\nA few years ago my business paid for 15+ AI tools. Today five tools run the whole six-figure operation, and Claude Code handles about 95% of the daily work.\n\nBefore any AI subscription renews, ask whether your", "url": "https://x.com/ryan_doser13/status/2122755399522693363"}], "includes": {"media": [{"height": 810, "media_key": "3_2122770050369339392", "type": "photo", "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HXWYHSgaQAA7Xfx.jpg", "width": 1440}, {"duration_ms": 58600, "height": 1080, "media_key": "13_2122745926452408320", "preview_image_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HXWCikRa4AAslgo.jpg", "type": "video", "variants": [{"bit_rate": 256000, "content_type": "video/mp4", "url": "https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2122745926452408320/vid/avc1/